# Stayfrosty UI

Read `packages/ui/README.md` and `packages/ui/AGENTS.md` before changing UI.

- Import from `@ui` and `@ui/icons`. Never `@mui/material`, `@mui/icons-material`, `@emotion/styled`, or `@emotion/react` in `src/`.
- `sx` + theme tokens only. No `styled()`, no `.styled.ts`.
- Composites for brand look; app keeps routing, data, and domain adapters.
- `UiProvider` around the tree and around UI tests.
